Fernhook had 24,886 closed-won deals in 2025. That counts weeks whose Monday falls in 2025, from 2025-01-06 through 2025-12-29. The data stops at the week of 2025-12-22, so the last week may not be fully loaded.

The latest weeks probably undercount deals, because recent leads haven't had time to close. The true 2025 total may be somewhat higher.

