The average closed-won deal size in 2025 was about $2,966 (USD). That is $73,823,500 of closed-won revenue over 24,886 deals. Revenue is first-year contract value.

The latest weeks of 2025 may undercount deals, because recent leads haven't had time to close. The true figure could shift slightly.

